# Quote form delivery (Web3Forms)
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter info@nationalmovers.co.nz
# 2. Confirm the email — they send you an access key
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the key below
#
# NOTE: this is inlined into the client bundle at BUILD time (the site is a
# static export), so you must re-run `npm run build` after changing it.
# The key is publishable and write-only: it can only deliver submissions to
# the inbox it was registered against.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
